---
// Candidates/src/pages/privacy.astro
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for the Wyoming 2026 Voter Guide." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Privacy Policy — Wyoming 2026 Voter Guide</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page-shell">
      <header class="site-header" aria-label="Candidates voter guide">
        <a class="brand-mark" href="/" aria-label="Candidates home">
          <span class="brand-mark__rule"></span>
          <span>
            <span class="brand-mark__project">The Integrity Project</span>
            <strong>Wyoming 2026</strong>
            <small>Primary Voter Guide</small>
          </span>
        </a>
      </header>

      <section class="privacy-content">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="meta">Effective Date: September 3, 2025 &mdash; Last updated: June 28, 2026</p>

        <p>The Wyoming 2026 Voter Guide is a public civic project
        operated by Skovgard for Senate. This policy explains how information is handled on this site.</p>

        <h2>Information Collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The voting address you enter for ballot lookup. This address is used only to match your legislative
          district and return the races on your ballot. It is not stored, linked to your identity, or used for
          any other purpose.</li>
          <li>GPS coordinates, if you choose to use the location button. These may be logged anonymously in
          aggregate to improve district-matching accuracy. They are not linked to your identity.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Bot Protection &mdash; Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
        <p>
          The ballot lookup form on this site uses <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>, an invisible security
          service that verifies visitors are human without displaying a visible CAPTCHA. Turnstile runs silently
          in the background. It does not use cookies for verification and does not collect personal information
          on our behalf.
        </p>
        <p>
          By using the ballot lookup form, you acknowledge that Cloudflare may process certain technical signals
          from your browser in accordance with the
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Addendum
          </a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell or share address or lookup data with third parties. Candidate and race data displayed
        on this site is drawn from publicly available Wyoming Secretary of State filings.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Skovgard for Senate &middot; 5685 Hanly Mills Wy, Casper, WY 82604 &middot;
        <a href="mailto:skovgard2026@gmail.com">skovgard2026@gmail.com</a></p>

        <p class="back-link"><a href="/">&larr; Back to voter guide</a></p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer" aria-label="Campaign disclaimer">
      <span class="site-footer__rule"></span>
      <p>Paid for by Skovgard for Senate</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 20px 80px;
  }
  .privacy-content h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--color-navy, #0f2742);
  }
  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-navy, #0f2742);
  }
  .privacy-content p,
  .privacy-content li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .privacy-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-content a {
    color: #b22234;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
